<title>USA: Connecticut $160 mln GOs priced by Merrill Lynch.</title>
<headline>Connecticut $160 mln GOs priced by Merrill Lynch.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co said it tentatively priced $160 million of State of Connecticut general obligation bonds, Series 1996 C.</p>
<p>The firm did not release preliminary pricing results.</p>
<p>RE: $160,650,000</p>
<p>GENERAL OBLIGATION BONDS</p>
